<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Serverless - Tag - loommii</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/serverless/</link><description>我的个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 15:42:40 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/serverless/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Deploying Sub-Store on Cloudflare Workers: A Zero-Server Guide</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/posts/substore_cloudflare_workers_deployment_guide/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:49:40 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/posts/substore_cloudflare_workers_deployment_guide/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/techarticle/">TechArticle</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="introduction"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#introduction" class="heading-mark"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sub-Store is the most popular subscription manager in the proxy community. It supports conversion to almost every client format — Clash / Surge / QX / Loon / sing-box — plus node management and stable subscription links.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Traditionally it runs as a Node.js app on a local machine, NAS, or router. If you have no always-on server and don&amp;rsquo;t want to buy a VPS for a small tool, the &lt;strong&gt;Cloudflare Workers free tier&lt;/strong&gt; is the ideal destination: generous free quota (100k requests/day), fast edge network, and direct access from mainland China via CDN.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This article explains how to deploy a fully functional Sub-Store for free on Cloudflare using the &lt;code&gt;Yu9191/sub-store-workers&lt;/code&gt; project.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>